# bankAccount Class
A C++ class that represents a bank account.

## Data DIctionary

| Attribute             |   Data Type       | Description   |
|-----------------------|-------------------|---------------|
| accountNumber         | std:: string      | stores the account number      |
| accountHolderName     | std:: string      | stores the account holder name |
| balance               | std:: string      | stores the account balance     |

## Methods List

| Method Signatures                   | Return Type | Description |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------|
| BankAccount()                       | Constructor | Default constructor         |
| BankAccount(string, string, double) | Constructor | Parameterized Constructor   |
| getAccountNumber()                  | string      | Returns Account Number      |
| getAccountHolderName()              | string      | Returns Account Holder Name |
| getBalance()                        | double      | Returns Balance             |
| setAccountHolderName(string)        | void        | Sets Account Holder Name    |
| deposit(double)                     | void        | Adds Money                  |
| withdraw(double)                    | void        | Removes Money               |